      "content": "$$\\sum_k \\nu(kn)|q(nk)|^2 = \\nu(n'n)\\{|q(nn')|^2 - |q(nn'')|^2\\} = \\frac{h}{8\\pi^2}, \\quad (58)$$",
      "confidenceScores": null,
      "type": "equation"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 108,
      "topLeftY": 471,
      "bottomRightX": 289,
      "bottomRightY": 489,
      "content": "und die Energie (52) wird:",
