      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 119,
      "topLeftY": 492,
      "bottomRightX": 572,
      "bottomRightY": 560,
      "content": "$$\\begin{aligned} H(nm) &= \\frac{1}{2}4\\pi^2 \\sum_k \\{-\\nu(nk)\\nu(km)q(nk)q(km) + \\nu_0^2 q(nk)q(km)\\} \\\\ &= 2\\pi^2 \\sum_k q(nk)q(km)\\{\\nu_0^2 - \\nu(nk)\\nu(km)\\}. \\end{aligned}$$",
      "confidenceScores": null,
      "type": "equation"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 108,
      "topLeftY": 565,
      "bottomRightX": 308,
      "bottomRightY": 582,
      "content": "Insbesondere gilt für $m = n$:",
      "confidenceScores": null,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 182,
      "topLeftY": 586,
      "bottomRightX": 587,
      "bottomRightY": 608,
      "content": "$$H(nn) = W_n = 4\\pi^2 \\nu_0^2 (|q(nn')|^2 + |q(nn'')|^2). \\quad (59)$$",
      "confidenceScores": null,
      "type": "equation"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 108,
      "topLeftY": 611,
      "bottomRightX": 369,
      "bottomRightY": 629,
      "content": "Es sind nun weiter drei Fälle möglich:",
      "confidenceScores": null,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
